			"notes": "# Sculk Horde 1.20.1-0.11.7 Available\n**Stability Rating:** Untested :yellow_circle: \n### General Changelog\n- Added new modular debugging system.\n- Added /shd debug to manipulate debugging system.\n- Fixed Mite Spawning in the deep dark.\n- Fixed load and save names in code.\n- Fixed phantoms spawning above the world\n- Updated Phantoms to regularly spawn also from nodes and not just the ancient node.\n\n### Experimental Mode Changes\n- Added Bread of Purity\n- Added Chicken of Purity\n- Added Beef of Purity\n- Added Pork of Purity\n- Added Baked Potato of Purity\n- Added WIP Perimeter Infestation Ward Relay\n- Added Ghast deployment events\n- Added ability for gravemind to save profiles on hostile mobs.\n- Added ability for lure to trigger ghast deployment events.\n- Updated Model and Texture for Sculk Ghast\n- Updated fireball attack to sculk ghast\n- Updated unit spawning from ghasts\n- Updated broodling model and behavior\n- Updated Broodhatcher behavior\n- Overhauled PathBuilder system"
